  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Dark Potential",
          "desc": "Human Form: Hits from Basic Attacks and skills grant madness. Ferali Form: Casting the skill reduces the Movement Speed of enemies in range."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Forbidden Domain",
          "desc": "Deals damage to enemies in range. Knocks back enemy heroes."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Leaping Savior",
          "desc": "Jumps to the target location, granting a shield to nearby teammates. Gains extra Madness for every teammate he shields."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Unbridled Outburst",
          "desc": "Roars and transforms, gaining brief Invincibility, then a shield. The roar forms a gust of wind that damages, knocks back, and stuns enemies. While inside the wind, Zhang Fei gains increased Movement Speed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Super Tanky throughout the game",
          "Strong engage and disengage",
          "Mobility to get over walls for vision"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Needs Ultimate to be useful",
          "Slow at helping clear waves"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nPrioritise pushing Mid Lane and roaming to Farm Lane to help secure jungle camps. Shield your teammates when the enemy is looking to trade damage. \n\n## Team Fights\nUse your Ultimate to catch enemies off guard or to start a teamfight. You can also use it defensively to disengage and stop the enemy from jumping onto your team.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\n- Use Frigid Charge after your Ultimate to keep enemies locked in one place\n- Attack minions and monsters to charge your passive to get your Ultimate sooner\n- Aim your Ultimate towards walls to make it easier to follow up "
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Zhang Fei lemah pas energinya belum penuh, serang di situ. 2) Pas teamfight jangan buang skill ke dia."
    },
